WEBVTT

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.427
[chuckles]

00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:13.097
Shouldn't we, uh, get some
special training for this?

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.598
Just don't-don't look down.

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:18.978
[Shark] Uh, follow-up question:

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.187
Which way is down?

00:00:21.105 --> 00:00:23.107
Listen up. This is all about timing.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.860
Webs, Shark, I need you
to hack the external console

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:28.362
while Snake and Piranha
pop the control panel

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.905
to engage the manual override switch.

00:00:29.989 --> 00:00:30.990
You got it.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:32.157
And what about Kitty?

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:33.492
Leave her to me.

00:00:34.118 --> 00:00:35.536
We got one shot to save the world.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:37.413
Let's make it count.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:41.000
[Tarantula] Okay, buddy. You can do this.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.127
-First, clear the root folder.
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.295
Then in system directory,

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:47.006
type "ENC underscore word
equals word dot encode."

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:49.758
Now, "import hashlib." Hit enter.

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:51.927
Then input "underscore path equals input.”

00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:53.429
Okay. Cool, cool. Got it.

00:00:54.138 --> 00:00:57.975
Okay, so, clear the root folder, you say.

00:00:58.517 --> 00:01:00.728
[Piranha breathing shakily]

00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:03.188
Okay, come on. Come on, Piranha.

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:04.398
You're not nervous, right?

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:07.151
"Cause we know what happens
when you're nervous.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.694
What would I be nervous about?

00:01:10.321 --> 00:01:11.947
-[farts]
-[Snake] Oh!

00:01:12.031 --> 00:01:13.616
Piranha. Dude.

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:15.993
-Sorry.
-I can taste it. [groans]

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.998
We're in position.

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:24.376
I think it's time we introduced ourselves.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.088
["Purple Hat" playing]

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.598
[phone vibrates]

00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:43.604
Whoa!

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:59.161
Oh. Thank you.

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:01.705
[crowd murmurs]

00:02:01.789 --> 00:02:02.790
Thank you.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.669
What's going on? Why am [ flying?

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:09.588
[screams]

00:02:17.012 --> 00:02:19.014
[song continues]

00:02:24.395 --> 00:02:25.646
Holy potatoes.

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:27.064
It's actually working.

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.148
Whoo! Yeah!

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:31.443
Oh, boy.

00:02:31.527 --> 00:02:32.861
How we doing, Snake?

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:34.279
Hang on.

00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:35.364
Got it!

00:02:35.447 --> 00:02:38.033
Like stealing candy and a baby.

00:02:38.117 --> 00:02:40.494
Don't you mean "candy from a baby"?

00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:42.246
I know what I said.

00:02:42.329 --> 00:02:43.664
How about the air lock?

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:45.833
[Shark exclaims, pants]

00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:48.419
All right, Webs, I like your style.

00:02:49.128 --> 00:02:51.130
Oh, that one was all Shark.

00:02:51.213 --> 00:02:52.214
I panicked!

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:54.049
But it worked out. I'm a programmer now.

00:02:55.092 --> 00:02:56.510
I'm going in.

00:02:58.262 --> 00:03:00.431
-[Snake grunting]
-[thuds]

00:03:00.514 --> 00:03:01.807
-What was that?
-Huh?

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.726
[intense music plays]

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:06.520
Ooh, that's not good.

00:03:10.065 --> 00:03:12.443
-[shudders]
-[clinking]

00:03:13.068 --> 00:03:14.403
[groans]

00:03:15.237 --> 00:03:16.905
Snake, buddy, I'm sorry.

00:03:16.989 --> 00:03:18.991
-What? No, no, no--
-[farts]

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:22.202
[Snake] I hate you.

00:03:22.286 --> 00:03:24.455
-[laser zapping]
-[gold clinking]

00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:29.626
[Tarantula] Get to the air lock!
Go, go, go!

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:32.463
[Kitty laughing]

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:37.509
Girls, nothing gonna stop us now.

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:42.431
[Snake panting]

00:03:44.141 --> 00:03:45.726
Snakey Cakes?

00:03:45.809 --> 00:03:48.854
[strained] Help me.

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:51.356
-[Piranha farting]
-[Snake] Stop farting...

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.358
[gasps] ...you maniac!

00:03:53.442 --> 00:03:54.902
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Come on.

00:03:54.985 --> 00:03:56.111
Turn it off. All right?

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:57.488
-You're gonna kill them!
-[grunts]

00:03:57.571 --> 00:04:00.365
I'm sorry. Whose side are you on?

00:04:00.449 --> 00:04:01.784
-[chokes]
-Kitty, stop!

00:04:01.867 --> 00:04:02.993
It's just a heist!

00:04:03.077 --> 00:04:05.037
-It's never just a heist!
-[grunts]

00:04:05.954 --> 00:04:07.790
Secure the air lock.

00:04:07.873 --> 00:04:09.083
Now!

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:11.543
Whatever you say, boss.

00:04:20.344 --> 00:04:24.139
Pfft. "Turn it off." Ha!
I'm just getting started.

00:04:24.223 --> 00:04:25.224
[device hums]

00:04:26.642 --> 00:04:28.018
[gold clinking]

00:04:36.068 --> 00:04:37.152
[screams]

00:04:37.236 --> 00:04:38.237
[tires squeal]

00:04:40.823 --> 00:04:42.199
[bystander screams]

00:04:42.908 --> 00:04:44.326
[clanking]

00:04:44.409 --> 00:04:45.786
<i>It is total mayhem!</i>

00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:48.997
A cataclysmic gold storm
is literally destroying the city!

00:04:49.081 --> 00:04:50.332
[screams]

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:54.169
[Kitty chuckles]

00:04:55.629 --> 00:04:57.256
Oh, yeah.

00:04:57.756 --> 00:05:00.467
The gold. Come to mama!

00:05:00.551 --> 00:05:02.302
-[Wolf] You know, I've been thinking.
-[gasps]

00:05:02.386 --> 00:05:03.512
Wolf?

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:05.347
Doesn't that word sound kind of made up?

00:05:05.931 --> 00:05:07.474
"Gold." It's kinda weird, right?

00:05:07.558 --> 00:05:09.184
It's weird. It's a weird word.

00:05:09.768 --> 00:05:11.937
Go ahead. Say "gold."

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.482
Gold. Gold. Gold.

00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:16.567
Anyway, it doesn't matter.

00:05:17.151 --> 00:05:19.403
I'm gonna need you to turn off the magnet.

00:05:19.987 --> 00:05:21.530
Or I'll just do it for you.

00:05:21.613 --> 00:05:23.907
Is that supposed to be funny?

00:05:27.411 --> 00:05:28.954
[both grunt]

00:05:29.538 --> 00:05:30.789
[groans]

00:05:31.373 --> 00:05:33.292
-[farts]
-[Snake groans]

00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:35.794
Stay with me, papo! Stay with me!

00:05:35.878 --> 00:05:38.213
[groans] I don't wanna die like this.

00:05:38.297 --> 00:05:39.590
[gags, grunts]

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:41.550
-[Piranha farts]
-[Snake groans] Oof.

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:42.759
[pants]

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:47.181
[Piranha gasps]

00:05:48.265 --> 00:05:49.391
Okay, okay.

00:05:49.892 --> 00:05:51.643
Come on, Piranha, your friend
is spinning out in space.

00:05:51.727 --> 00:05:52.936
You should know what to do.

00:05:54.563 --> 00:05:56.690
-[triumphant music plays]
-That's it! The pen!

00:05:56.773 --> 00:05:58.317
The pen? Wha--

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.776
Grab the pen! The pen!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.653
Grab the-- Oh, no, no, no.

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:04.489
Okay, I can do stuff. I can do stuff.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.366
[intense music plays]

00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:10.245
[shouts]

00:06:10.954 --> 00:06:12.331
[Wolf gasping]

00:06:12.998 --> 00:06:14.708
[grunts, shouts]

00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:18.462
Why would you risk your life
to save people

00:06:18.545 --> 00:06:20.214
who wouldn't even give you a chance?

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:22.466
[grunts]

00:06:23.425 --> 00:06:27.262
At least when you were the Big Bad Wolf,
they respected you.

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:30.349
Now, that was respect, huh?

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:31.850
That wasn't respect, that was fear.

00:06:31.934 --> 00:06:35.395
[groans] Whatever, man.
What's the difference?

00:06:35.479 --> 00:06:36.939
Trust me, there's a difference.

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.107
Respect is earned.

00:06:39.942 --> 00:06:41.193
One day, you'll learn that.

00:06:41.818 --> 00:06:42.819
[spits]

00:06:43.904 --> 00:06:45.739
[Kitty growls]

